", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@La_Lune_000/works/19", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/2893dbe5/uploads/origins/cbd45e48-654f-458b-96cf-4000077c0131?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bf671fb8003d3adca250c9f57fe1b2ae", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2893dbe5/uploads/origins/cbd45e48-654f-458b-96cf-4000077c0131?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bf671fb8003d3adca250c9f57fe1b2ae, https://si.imgix.net/2893dbe5/uploads/origins/cbd45e48-654f-458b-96cf-4000077c0131?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=69532eefe9c7d9f8d8db712bb1afdc48 2x, https://si.imgix.net/2893dbe5/uploads/origins/cbd45e48-654f-458b-96cf-4000077c0131?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c859253d1a129af7054b29944b631b09 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "お世話になります。\n湊あくあちゃんぽい、裾が長過ぎない膝丈くらいのメイド服で、カラーはピンクか黒か紺で、私を描いて欲しいです。\n背景は、海っぽい背景でお願いします。\n\n使用目的は、壁紙やアイコンにさせて頂く予定です。\n可能であれば、サインと背景は、レイヤー分けして頂けると助かります。\n\nhttps://x.com/samii_yuzuki?s=21\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/live/Wk6_soH7ofI?si=Iw26dv6HOry-cT5X", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@La_Lune_000/works/18", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/d644cc44/uploads/origins/45d61a84-d355-42dc-b6ce-ea1e8229ad6f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ae1caffc7889dab6f741505739d8ab6b", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d644cc44/uploads/origins/45d61a84-d355-42dc-b6ce-ea1e8229ad6f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ae1caffc7889dab6f741505739d8ab6b, https://si.imgix.net/d644cc44/uploads/origins/45d61a84-d355-42dc-b6ce-ea1e8229ad6f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a1c4b339035edced53a9d09f82f29d57 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d644cc44/uploads/origins/45d61a84-d355-42dc-b6ce-ea1e8229ad6f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=web